  "remaining": [
    "Host trust covers systemd, logind, the intended service control socket and the kernel contracts for flock, privileged inode attributes, child adoption and recursive cgroup population.",
    "Recovery covers work descended from the recorded operation in the four fixed units. A privileged hook that delegates work into another service or to a hypervisor requires separate mediation.",
    "An untracked legacy S cannot establish how its power work was launched. The cold-boot procedure remains applicable."
